sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User client
    participant A as HTTP API
    participant T as Turn Worker
    participant C as Conversation Agent
    participant M as MCP Server
    participant R as Research Service
    participant W as Run Worker
    participant L as Lifecycle Worker
    participant D as SQLite

    U->>A: POST message with operation key and expected revision
    A->>D: append user message event and Turn job atomically
    A-->>U: 202 Accepted with message and Turn IDs
    D-->>T: lease Turn job
    T->>C: invoke with reconstructed context
    C->>M: start_research(question conditions scope result refs)
    M->>R: submit under trusted delegated ActorContext
    R->>D: create one queued Run and Run job
    par durable research and result publication
        D-->>W: lease same Run job
        W->>R: execute through RunHarness
        R->>D: finalize Run outcome and completion job atomically
        D-->>L: lease completion job
        L->>D: publish Result link and events atomically
    and bounded MCP observation
        loop until Result terminal Run or 10 second deadline
            M->>D: observe same Run and Result
        end
    end
    alt Result available within 10 seconds
        M-->>C: completed with Run and Result
        C->>D: append cited assistant reply and Turn completion
        D-->>U: Conversation events over SSE
    else Run still queued or running
        M-->>C: accepted with Run ID and status
        C->>D: append submission acknowledgement and complete Turn
        D-->>U: Conversation events over SSE
    else Run reached abnormal terminal state
        M-->>C: terminal status with safe failure projection
        C->>D: append failure status and recovery actions
        D-->>U: Conversation events over SSE
    end
